WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:40.000
[Instrumental Intro]

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:43.800
The curvature is turning violet and gold

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:46.800
The greatest wonder that was ever told

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:50.000
A thin blue ribbon against the infinite black

00:00:50.200 --> 00:00:53.200
We've come too far to ever look back

00:00:53.500 --> 00:00:56.800
Every road that we drove in the rain

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:59.800
Every mile of the heartbreak and pain

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:03.200
Was just a runway leading up to the sky

00:01:03.500 --> 00:01:06.200
Teaching a heavy machine how to fly

00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:09.800
Out on the horizon line!

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:13.000
Where the earth and the heavens align!

00:01:13.200 --> 00:01:16.200
Leaving terrestrial time behind

00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:19.500
Out on the horizon line!

00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:22.800
Can you see it shining in my eyes?

00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:26.000
The promise of a million sunrises!

00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:29.200
Nothing left to measure or define

00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:32.500
Out on the horizon line!

00:01:33.000 --> 00:01:36.200
The old static is fading away

00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:39.200
Into the break of a brand new day

00:01:39.500 --> 00:01:42.800
You take the helm and I'll read the chart

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:45.800
Navigated by the beat of a human heart

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:49.200
We don't need a map where we're going now

00:01:49.500 --> 00:01:52.200
We made it through the storm, it doesn't matter how

00:01:52.500 --> 00:01:55.500
Just open up the throttle and let the colors pour

00:01:55.800 --> 00:01:58.500
Through the open door!

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.000
Out on the horizon line!

00:02:02.200 --> 00:02:05.200
Where the earth and the heavens align!

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:08.500
Leaving terrestrial time behind

00:02:08.800 --> 00:02:11.800
Out on the horizon line!

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:15.200
Can you see it shining in my eyes?

00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:18.500
The promise of a million sunrises!

00:02:18.800 --> 00:02:21.800
Nothing left to measure or define

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:25.000
Out on the horizon line!

00:02:25.500 --> 00:02:29.500
The colors bloom, the shadows fall

00:02:29.800 --> 00:02:33.800
We finally hear the cosmic call

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:38.000
No more East and no more West

00:02:38.200 --> 00:02:42.500
Above the world, beyond the rest!

00:02:43.000 --> 00:03:22.000
[Synthesizer Brass Solo]

00:03:22.500 --> 00:03:28.500
Out on the horizon line!

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:35.200
Where the earth and the heavens align!

00:03:35.500 --> 00:03:41.800
Leaving terrestrial time behind

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:48.500
Out on the horizon line!

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:55.000
The horizon line...

00:03:55.500 --> 00:04:02.000
Where the heavens align...

00:04:02.500 --> 00:04:31.500
[Outro]
